category: 'private'
method: UTF8Encoding
copyright
	"#trailingBytesForUTF8:, #isLegalUTF8: and #sizeOf: based on sample code from
	http://www.unicode.org/Public/PROGRAMS/CVTUTF/ConvertUTF.c. Rest of code 
	courtesy of Robert Love"
